   "slow": "audio/8480091329b33a73.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Son doscientos ochenta.": {
   "normal": "audio/9a01dd58b9c2d708.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/29ef575553099d44.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Quiero dos aguas.": {
   "normal": "audio/52f952bc9774b603.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/f2bd4d6c4c73ff7c.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Te lo dejo en ochenta.": {
   "normal": "audio/d42ebfde0346142b.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/c9fec7edcca56e13.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Dura dos horas.": {
   "normal": "audio/8a7b2a64c8b55205.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/431ef7e675ce4ebe.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "A las ocho y media.": {
   "normal": "audio/9426a62237bc8539.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/2b8d417136e84df1.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Va a ir mañana.": {
   "normal": "audio/65e319aad82ee891.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/3ac5fa48e98f4e1e.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Son las once y cuarto.": {
   "normal": "audio/1b602dc3e9d732be.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/a0dabe6a2b591232.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Voy a llegar a las dos.": {
   "normal": "audio/a69a4077ab70647b.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/92e64d3b9aff2249.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Mi amiga prefirió el matcha frío.": {
   "normal": "audio/4c024f440a4e44be.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/943de22fb4d81c88.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Anoche en el estudio pidieron tres pizzas.": {
   "normal": "audio/1b777702972dce9e.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/8a43d4b25a701cb8.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "En el vuelo a Tokio, mi hermano durmió once horas.": {
   "normal": "audio/6b62988b59878b6c.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/d3c6bd2302d43698.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Los vecinos oyeron la música de la fiesta hasta las tres.": {
   "normal": "audio/ae8f76c50e13ce56.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/0328956efe9e3e69.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "Construyeron el escenario del festival en seis días.": {
   "normal": "audio/8e2909673f1230f7.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/1ef807672dddb0ac.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "El público eligió la última canción, y el concierto terminó a las doce y cuarto.": {
   "normal": "audio/b48c79f926ed11cd.mp3",
   "slow": "audio/411e55c21b58f6fa.mp3",
   "voice": "male"
  },
  "¿Qué pidieron en el café? Yo pedí un matcha, y mis amigos pidieron dos cafés de olla.": {
   "voice": "dialogue",
   "lines": [
    {
     "speaker": "Amigo",
     "voice": "male",
     "es": "¿Qué pidieron en el café?"
    },
